          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit is **under orders**, each time a shooting attack made by this unit scores a critical hit, subtract 1&quot; from the target unit&apos;s Move characteristic until the start of your next turn (this effect is cumulative). This ability cannot reduce the target unit&apos;s unmodified Move characteristic below half its starting value.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
